# 必考词 Unit 12 短语

## 常考短语

- **exert influence/pressure on**: 对…施加影响/压力 — The media exerts great influence on public opinion. 媒体对公众舆论施加很大影响。
- **exhaust one's patience**: 用尽耐心 — His constant complaints exhausted my patience. 他不断的抱怨耗尽了我的耐心。
- **on exhibit**: 在展出 — Several paintings are on exhibit at the gallery. 几幅画在画廊展出。
- **expand one's horizons**: 开阔视野 — Traveling helps expand your horizons. 旅行有助于开阔视野。
- **at the expense of**: 以…为代价 — He gained wealth at the expense of his health. 他以健康为代价获得了财富。
- **exploit natural resources**: 开发自然资源 — We should not overexploit natural resources. 我们不应过度开发自然资源。
- **explore the possibility of**: 探索…的可能性 — We should explore the possibility of cooperation. 我们应该探索合作的可能性。
- **be exposed to**: 接触到；暴露于 — Children are exposed to many influences. 孩子们接触到很多影响。
- **extend an invitation**: 发出邀请 — We extended an invitation to all the employees. 我们向所有员工发出了邀请。
- **to a great/large extent**: 在很大程度上 — To a great extent, success depends on effort. 在很大程度上，成功取决于努力。
- **extreme weather**: 极端天气 — The region has been experiencing extreme weather conditions. 该地区一直在经历极端天气。
- **fail to do sth.**: 未能做某事 — He failed to meet the deadline. 他未能按时完成。
- **have faith in**: 对…有信心 — She has faith in her team. 她对团队有信心。
- **fancy doing sth.**: 想要做某事 — Do you fancy going to the cinema? 你想去看电影吗？
- **be fascinated by**: 被…迷住 — She was fascinated by the history of the city. 她被这座城市的历史迷住了。
- **a fatal mistake**: 致命的错误 — Ignoring the warning was a fatal mistake. 忽视警告是一个致命错误。
- **find fault with**: 挑剔；找茬 — She always finds fault with others. 她总是挑剔别人。
- **do sb. a favor**: 帮某人一个忙 — Could you do me a favor? 你能帮我一个忙吗？
- **in favor of**: 赞成 — Most people voted in favor of the proposal. 大多数人投票赞成这项提案。
- **figure out**: 弄清楚 — I can't figure out how to solve this problem. 我弄不清楚如何解决这个问题。
